Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.88,0:01:14.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多一点血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.56,0:01:18.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了 继续加 再加一些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great. Keep it coming. Chuck, Terry, pump away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.48,0:01:20.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别那么小气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be stingy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.48,0:01:22.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心那个手臂 我可以看到那个假手臂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, watch that arm. I can see that fake arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.64,0:01:24.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,契斯 让那个爪子继续动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chase, keep that claw really moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.40,0:01:27.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰佛瑞 像佛莱迪把它装上去 非常好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jeffrey, jam it on there just like Freddy would. Good. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.48,0:01:29.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡 冲洗出来看一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And cut. Print that, Gretchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.32,0:01:32.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 冲洗第七场就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, sir. Printing seven only.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.40,0:01:37.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这让他之前的手爪看起来像是泰瑞莎修女的手套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a genius. This makes his old claw look like Mother Teresa's mitten.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.92,0:01:40.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢它们吧 它们非常敏感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better thank them, they're very sensitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.44,0:01:43.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 查克 泰瑞 假血很不错 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Chuck, Terry, great blood. - Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.52,0:01:45.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的代表作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some of our best work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.20,0:01:46.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要看一些很酷的东西吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monkey man, wanna see some neat stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.08,0:01:48.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 契斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah! - Chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.24,0:01:49.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.08,0:01:51.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它只是做的很逼真\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's only make-believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.88,0:01:54.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 玛莉安 我得走了 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Marianne, I gotta go. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.04,0:02:00.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,低头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Low bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.48,0:02:07.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来看看我们能不能找到一些东西好好吓一下妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll see if we can't find someone's to scare the pj's off of Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.20,0:02:12.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海瑟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Heather.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.52,0:02:22.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你饿了吗 迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hungry, Dylan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.36,0:02:29.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,骗到你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooh, gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.72,0:02:31.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它的反射动作应该更好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It should have flexed more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.20,0:02:34.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,契斯 假血让伺服器短路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chase, I think the servos got shorted out with blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.96,0:02:39.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把它拆掉 拿出伺服器 用保丽龙包好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, take it apart, pull it out, and insulate them with some styro.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.04,0:02:43.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它不应该沾到血的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thing wasn't meant to be submerged, for Pete's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.08,0:02:45.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不喜欢那个东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't like that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.28,0:02:46.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它让我们全家不致于饿肚子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It puts bread on our table.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.00,0:02:48.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它是真的吗 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it alive, Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.96,0:02:51.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海瑟 接下来轮到你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heather, you're in the next shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.92,0:02:54.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先进机器人设计 使用生物有机外皮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}State-of-the-art animatronics enhanced with bio-organic grafting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.16,0:02:56.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,牛腱组织\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bull tendons.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.44,0:02:59.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 杜宾狗的神经束 - 契斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nerve bundles from a live Doberman. - Chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.52,0:03:06.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.52,0:03:13.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 查克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit, Chuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.00,0:03:17.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它应该是接收到对讲机讯号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, it must have picked up a signal from an AD's walkie-talkie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.72,0:03:19.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你确定关了吗 - 我把它关掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You sure it's turned off? - It's off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.80,0:03:23.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它是温的 跟真的手一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's funny, it's warm, just like a real hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.16,0:03:28.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.04,0:03:34.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生了什么事 关掉特效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is going on? Cut the effects!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.72,0:03:41.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,契斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chase!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.24,0:03:43.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,泰端 它在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Terry, where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.48,0:03:44.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,泰端\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Terry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.92,0:03:46.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chuck, get off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.20,0:03:48.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海瑟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heather!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.40,0:03:50.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 海瑟 它在哪里 - 契斯 它在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Heather, where is it? - Chase, where the hell is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.24,0:03:55.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.56,0:03:56.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.08,0:04:05.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.32,0:04:11.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.68,0:04:17.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,契斯 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chase! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.36,0:04:20.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是地震 来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Earthquake. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.48,0:04:29.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.36,0:04:30.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.16,0:04:36.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan! Dylan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.08,0:04:41.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.20,0:05:03.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.20,0:05:04.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汽车防盗器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Car alarms.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.56,0:05:11.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 - 没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.88,0:05:14.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧 儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay, chief?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.48,0:05:15.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不 - 嘿嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Heh, heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.16,0:05:18.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 甜心 你发烧了吗 - 只是地震而已 迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Honey, do you have a fever? - Just another earthquake, Dylan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.96,0:05:22.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 很好玩吧 - 爸爸 你流血了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Getting kind of fun, huh? - Daddy, blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.48,0:05:25.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的 各位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's nothing, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.40,0:05:28.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是擦伤 真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a scratch. Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.28,0:05:29.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么受伤的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.96,0:05:33.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想是被掉下来的照片弄伤的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. Picture, I guess. The one that fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.56,0:05:34.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么大不了的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.00,0:05:36.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,包扎一下就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put a bandage on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.12,0:05:39.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.76,0:05:48.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加州理工学院的地质学家确认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Geologists at Caltech have confirmed...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.16,0:05:52.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 今天早上的余震 - 我们非看那个不可吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...that this morning's aftershock.... - Do we have to watch that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.80,0:05:53.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(地震探测)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.76,0:05:56.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是你把电视打开的 - 对已经受损的停车场结构\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You turned it on. - It caused further collapse...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.84,0:05:59.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,造成进一步伤害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...of the already badly damaged parking structure....
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.48,0:06:01.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去把它关掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll turn it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.76,0:06:05.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这很正常 上星期发生的强震\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is normal, following a quake of last week's magnitude...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.96,0:06:08.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,规模是六点八级\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...now thought to be a massive 6. 8.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.84,0:06:13.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦 这是早餐 不是美术课时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan, this is breakfast, not arts and crafts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.36,0:06:16.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.04,0:06:18.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨晚你有睡吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you get any sleep last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.08,0:06:21.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,睡了一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More or Iess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.40,0:06:24.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 该换衣服了 我会迟到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, time to get dressed. I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.44,0:06:26.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要出门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going away?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.28,0:06:29.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只离开几小时 茱莉会来陪你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just for a few hours. Julie will be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.72,0:06:38.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有其他的事困扰着你吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there anything other than the obvious bothering you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.24,0:06:41.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三周内发生五次地震 真的够严重了 甜心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think five earthquakes in three weeks is enough, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.00,0:06:45.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你该不会又接到电话了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hasn't been another phone call, has there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.32,0:06:46.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.80,0:06:51.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是个好迹象 他消失了两个星期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good sign. Two full weeks without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.20,0:06:52.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许他被卡车撞死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe he got hit by a truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.00,0:06:55.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得他是更加接近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's closer, if anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.48,0:06:57.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这让我做恶梦 契斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's giving me nightmares, Chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.00,0:07:00.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨晚你做了恶梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you have one last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.84,0:07:05.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是地震而已 海瑟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, it's just the earthquakes, Heather.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.24,0:07:06.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.52,0:07:09.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许今天我不该接受访问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I shouldn't do this interview today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.60,0:07:14.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 你总得恢复正常生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. You've gotta get back on the horse sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.72,0:07:17.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 有个疯子打骚扰电话给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, you had a nutcase making harassing phone calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.92,0:07:22.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我知道那有多可怕 - 不 你不了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I know how scary that's been. - No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.92,0:07:26.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 我是不了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.24,0:07:28.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但那不代表我们不能忘了这一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it doesn't mean that it can't be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.84,0:07:31.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果一切还没有结束呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but what if it isn't over?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.88,0:07:35.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许你该跟我谈谈你的梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you should tell me your dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.72,0:07:39.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, it was nothing. It was....
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.52,0:07:43.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟我合拍电影 我们终于一起合作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and I were working on this movie, together for once...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.20,0:07:46.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做的特效出了间题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and one of your special effects went really wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.48,0:07:51.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,查克跟泰瑞受伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Chuck and Terry got hurt...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.60,0:07:55.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的手指被切断\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and, heh, well, your fingers were cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.76,0:07:58.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.88,0:08:04.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海瑟 或许你是半梦半醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heather, you were probably half-awake...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.20,0:08:07.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到我的手指 被掉下来的镜子割伤 梦就是那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and saw my fingers get nicked when the mirror fell. Dreams are like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.24,0:08:15.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 如果你不要我接下这份工作 我可以放弃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, if you don't want me to go on this job, I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.88,0:08:20.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心点 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pfft! Just be careful, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.68,0:08:23.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以到棕榈泉待两天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I can survive two days in Palm Springs...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.20,0:08:25.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为体香剂广告做泡泡特效 你觉得呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...supplying soap bubbles for a detergent commercial, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.08,0:08:27.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.44,0:08:29.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你想是吧 - 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You guess so? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.24,0:08:30.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.64,0:08:42.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,48小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mmm. Forty eight hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.56,0:08:45.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会准时回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be back in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.36,0:08:48.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我得走了 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I gotta go. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.96,0:08:52.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.72,0:08:58.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的设计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love what you've done with the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.12,0:09:01.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给他们好看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Knock them dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.68,0:09:07.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦 我得走了 好好照顾妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan, I gotta go! Take care of Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.48,0:09:08.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.56,0:09:33.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南希\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.00,0:09:36.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.56,0:09:39.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南希\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.12,0:09:43.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦 我不要你看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan, I don't want you watching this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.76,0:09:50.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 怎么了 你是怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? What's wrong? What's gotten into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.08,0:10:06.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.28,0:10:09.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一 二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One, two...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.72,0:10:23.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哈罗 - 佛莱迪要来抓你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello? - Freddy's coming for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.60,0:10:28.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,契斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chase!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.12,0:10:40.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得不太对劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.00,0:10:42.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.64,0:11:01.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 甜心 - 没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you okay, honey? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.00,0:11:08.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海瑟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heather!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.76,0:11:16.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.60,0:11:19.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.28,0:11:22.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事 只是地震 刚刚你感觉到地震了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Just these quakes. Did you feel a little one just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.28,0:11:24.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 只是一辆卡车经过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no. A truck went by right before you opened the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.76,0:11:26.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在抢修水管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's life on the fault line.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.92,0:11:28.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 宝贝 - 茱莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, tiger. - Hi, Julie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.44,0:11:34.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得他烫烫的吗 今天早上他发烧了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does he feel warm to you? He had a fever this morning, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.44,0:11:37.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 他没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm. No. He seems okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.32,0:11:40.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你确定只是那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure that's all that's wrong? You seem...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.28,0:11:45.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别来烦我们 你这个混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave us alone, you son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.48,0:11:47.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛杉矶礼车公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}L.A. Limousine, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.44,0:11:50.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小姐 我已经到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just wanted you to know I'm out front.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.00,0:11:59.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 你能等一下吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry! Can you hang on a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.32,0:12:08.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海瑟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heather.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.28,0:12:13.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is it? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.00,0:12:15.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天我觉得怪怪的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just have this weird feeling today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.12,0:12:17.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mommy...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.16,0:12:20.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那么待在家里 - 迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...stay home, then. - Dylan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.32,0:12:28.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打骚扰电话的家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This damn caller.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.32,0:12:32.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他又来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He started again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.48,0:12:35.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大变态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sick fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.56,0:12:38.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.40,0:12:42.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦应该没发烧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Dylan doesn't seem to have a fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.48,0:12:44.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许是你太紧张了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's probably just your nerves.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.00,0:12:46.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nerves?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.76,0:12:50.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说因为早上发生地震\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just meant from the shaker this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.60,0:12:53.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都吓坏了 最近老是发生地震\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, everybody's freaked out about how many we've been having.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.40,0:12:54.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加上那些骚扰电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then these phone calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.48,0:13:00.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别接\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't answer it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.36,0:13:11.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 对不起 小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello? - Excuse me, ma'am...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.56,0:13:14.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们要迟到了 - 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...but we are going to be late. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.36,0:13:26.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.08,0:13:29.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得走了 你能原谅我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta go. Forgive me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.00,0:13:31.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.32,0:13:48.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会帮你打电话报警 我的联络方式在冰箱上 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll, uh, call the cops for you. You've got the number on the fridge, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.88,0:13:52.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们打电话来时告诉他们 他们应该会追踪这件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just give them the time they called and they're keeping this list, supposedly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.60,0:13:54.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,茱莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Julie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.92,0:13:56.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 我太神经兮兮了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm really sorry. My nerves are a little raw.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.16,0:13:58.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.96,0:14:07.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 我得挂电话了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.52,0:14:10.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 早安 - 早安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Morning. - Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.96,0:14:27.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你饰演那个女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You play that girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.60,0:14:31.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那部电影里 那个有怪手的家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In that movie. With the guy with the pfft!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.44,0:14:35.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 就是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, sure. That's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.40,0:14:39.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是我喜欢这份工作的原因 我可以看到大明星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, that's what I love about this job. I get to meet the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.88,0:14:41.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不算是明星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm hardly a star.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.60,0:14:43.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 你在开玩笑吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.80,0:14:46.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的作品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.64,0:14:48.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一集最精彩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The first was the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.84,0:14:51.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的姊妹淘被开肠剖肚 还被人拖过天花板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your girlfriend's cut open and dragged across the ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.16,0:14:53.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那真的是太恐怖了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.32,0:14:55.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你男朋友的床开始喷血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When that blood comes out of your boyfriend's bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.44,0:14:58.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我被吓到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I thought I'd shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.88,0:15:01.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不该杀死佛莱迪的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they never should have killed off Freddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.64,0:15:04.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海瑟 听着 我们得快一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heather, look, we gotta go! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.36,0:15:07.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你差点就迟到了 你想害我被开除吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Cutting it close, aren't you? Trying to get me fired?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.80,0:15:09.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 我们来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, okay, okay! We're coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.84,0:15:11.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来了 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're coming. No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.20,0:15:15.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海瑟 《半夜鬼上床》系列\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, Heather, we're approaching the 10th anniversary...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.32,0:15:17.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即将要欢庆 十周年纪念\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...of this Nightmare on Elm Street thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.28,0:15:20.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一集跟后面的五集续集非常地受欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean the original five very popular sequels.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.60,0:15:25.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样的成功纪录 对你个人有什么影响\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How has all this success affected you personally?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.60,0:15:28.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道它有没有影响 山姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I don't know if it really has, Sam. Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.12,0:15:32.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了第一集跟第三集 我没有参与其他的续集演出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With the exception of 1 and 3, I pretty much stayed out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.40,0:15:34.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我拍电视影集\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I'm doing a lot more television now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.80,0:15:37.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,花很多时间陪我丈夫跟儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those hours let me spend more time with my husband and my little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.76,0:15:39.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 你有个儿子 他叫什么名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right, you have a little boy. What's his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.44,0:15:42.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.92,0:15:45.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生下迪伦让你改变了 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With Dylan, does that change your feeling,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.19,0:15:47.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对恐怖电影的看法吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your perspective about horror movies?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.44,0:15:49.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 完全不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.20,0:15:50.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说你会让他看 你拍的电影吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you let him see one of your movies?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.16,0:15:53.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我儿子 不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My son? Heh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.44,0:15:55.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信大家常问你这个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure people always ask you this all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.72,0:15:57.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们会再拍续集吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there going to be another sequel?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.92,0:16:01.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有佛莱迪真的死了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what's more, is Freddy really dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.48,0:16:04.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然他死了 佛莱迪已经消失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course he is. Freddy's dead and gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.60,0:16:08.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟你合演第一集的演员呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about your co-star in the original, in Nightmare 1?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.36,0:16:10.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会让他跟迪伦独处吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you trust him alone with Dylan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.96,0:16:13.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,劳勃 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Robert? Heh. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.48,0:16:15.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么我们不问问他呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't we ask him how he'd feel about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.88,0:16:19.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们为你与观众准备了一个惊喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got a big surprise for you, Heather. And for our audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.40,0:16:21.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎他出场 他是最受欢迎的恶鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's bring him out, he is the best of the bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.00,0:16:24.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎劳勃英格朗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's say hello to Robert Englund!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.76,0:16:35.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Love you, babe!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.04,0:16:38.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一起吃午餐吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll do lunch! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.56,0:16:44.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.52,0:16:47.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佛莱迪回来了 欢迎佛莱迪叔叔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freddy's back! Give it up for your Uncle Freddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.92,0:16:53.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为你终于可以好好睡一觉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just when you thought it was safe to get back into bed!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.08,0:16:58.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我击掌吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me five!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.60,0:17:06.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来了 我比以前更坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm back and I'm badder than ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.52,0:17:10.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佛莱迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freddy! Freddy! Freddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.44,0:17:14.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在你们都是我的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ha! You are all my children now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.80,0:17:24.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们得走了 劳勃 - 等一下 我送你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We've gotta go, Robert. - Um, just a second. I'll walk you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.84,0:17:26.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 来吧 孩子 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There you go, Christy. - Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.04,0:17:29.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 再见 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bye-bye! - Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.20,0:17:31.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 - 我很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You okay? - I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.44,0:17:33.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切都很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. Everything went great, I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.88,0:17:37.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们真的吓到你了吧 - 我不知道为什么你不告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We really got you, didn't we? - I don't know why you didn't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.76,0:17:40.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们喜欢你的表情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, they loved the expression on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.12,0:17:44.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他们希望我们能再度合作 - 拍浪漫喜剧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They'd like to see us together again. - ln what, a romantic comedy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.72,0:17:46.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使是爱情故事 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just because it's a love story
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.43,0:17:49.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不代表我们不能砍掉几个人的头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}doesn't mean you can't have a decapitation or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.28,0:17:52.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 海瑟 找你的电话 - 我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Heather, there's a call for you. - For me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.64,0:17:55.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 再聊吧 - 再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Listen, I'll talk to you later. Bye-bye. - Bye-Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.88,0:17:56.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.08,0:17:59.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海瑟 我是新线影业的莎拉·瑞雪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heather, it's Sara Risher over at New Line Cinema.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.16,0:18:01.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.44,0:18:04.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨 莎拉 你好 好久不见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Sara. How are you? This is a voice from the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.24,0:18:07.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只会耽误你一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It sure is. Well, listen, Heather, I won't take but a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.52,0:18:09.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有份工作要跟你谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just that we have something to propose to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.92,0:18:13.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道你能不能到办公室来一趟 巴伯想跟你谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and I wonder if you'd stop by the offices. Bob would love to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.08,0:18:15.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题 什么时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, sure. When?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.36,0:18:17.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,择日不如撞日 礼车会送你过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No time like the present. The car will bring you over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.84,0:18:19.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 现在吗 - 一下子就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now? - Just take a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.56,0:18:22.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会很高兴你决定这么做的 再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be glad you did, I bet. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.96,0:18:49.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 需要我效劳吗 - 我来找巴伯·夏伊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can I help you? - I'm here to see Bob Shaye.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.84,0:18:51.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴伯跟你有约吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was Bob expecting you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.32,0:18:54.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 海瑟 - 莎拉 你好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Heather? Hi. - Sara, how are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.64,0:18:56.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我很好 你呢 - 很高兴能见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm fine. How are you? - Great to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.88,0:18:58.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你看起来好漂亮 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You look great. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.44,0:19:00.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴伯在等你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bob is dying to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.32,0:19:02.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你要喝点东西吗 - 咖啡就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can I get you something to drink? - Coffee would be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.92,0:19:04.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 黑咖啡好吗 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Black? - Black's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.40,0:19:05.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金 麻烦帮我们倒咖啡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kim, could you get us some coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.92,0:19:07.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sure. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.64,0:19:09.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得那家伙是混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think the guy's a little bit of a jerk...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.80,0:19:11.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但看到剧本才能知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but we won't know until we've read the script.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.00,0:19:14.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 我拿到剧本再打电话给你 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyhow, I'll give you a call when...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.43,0:19:15.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 我得挂电话了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Listen, man, I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.04,0:19:18.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 到米兰后打电话给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks. - Call me when you get to Milan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.36,0:19:21.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别忘了意式炖饭小馆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And don't forget, risotto con tartufo. It's fantastico.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.08,0:19:23.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保重 再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take care, man. I'll talk to you later. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.12,0:19:27.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 你看起来好漂亮 海瑟 你好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boy, do you look great, Heather. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.00,0:19:30.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.36,0:19:32.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不必问你过得好不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have to ask how you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.80,0:19:34.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目前为止还不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, so far, so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.32,0:19:37.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以今天我们请你过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which, by the way, is why we asked you to come by today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.72,0:19:40.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 金 - 不客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ah, thanks, Kim. - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.92,0:19:43.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海瑟 我就直说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Heather, let me cut to the chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.04,0:19:48.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要加入我们回到恶梦里吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How would you like to join us in the definitive Nightmare?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.04,0:19:51.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为你们杀死佛莱迪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you killed Freddy off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.44,0:19:54.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 但影迷 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we did, but the fans...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.44,0:19:57.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上帝保佑他们 他们想再看到续集\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, the fans, God bless them, they're clamoring for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.68,0:19:59.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想邪恶力量不死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess evil never dies, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.80,0:20:01.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之几星期前威斯打电话给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyhow, a few weeks ago I got a call from Wes...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.88,0:20:03.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他提出一个非常棒的点子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and he pitched me this really exciting idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.96,0:20:08.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我心想"有谁比原创者 更适合让佛莱迪复活"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I started thinking, "Who better to resurrect Freddy than his creator? "
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.80,0:20:11.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,威斯不再拍恐怖电影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I thought Wes stopped doing horror movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.48,0:20:14.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说十年来他不跟我联络\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know he actually told me he hadn't called in the last 10 years...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.64,0:20:17.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他一直没有 再做可怕的恶梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...because he hadn't had any really scary nightmares.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.08,0:20:20.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们是这个系列的灵感来源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're his inspiration for this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.88,0:20:23.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之他正在写剧本\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyhow, he's right in the middle of the script.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.60,0:20:26.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,代表他又开始做恶梦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which means he's having nightmares again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.56,0:20:28.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他真的很兴奋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he's very excited about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.40,0:20:30.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 关于恶梦 - 不 甜心 关于剧本\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The nightmares? - No, sweetie, the script.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.44,0:20:35.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也该觉得兴奋 因为你是主角\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you should be too, because you're the star.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.16,0:20:38.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道 巴伯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.12,0:20:41.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的是受宠若惊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm flattered, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.32,0:20:44.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 但现在我有孩子了 - 所以呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But I have a kid now and... - Well, so?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.84,0:20:47.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想再拍恐怖片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I'm not sure about doing horror.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.84,0:20:49.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少来了 海瑟 小孩子喜欢恐怖片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, come on, Heather. Kids love horror.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.04,0:20:54.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 巴伯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you so much, Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.68,0:20:56.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有其他的计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have other things happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.12,0:20:59.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会出一样的价钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promise you we'll match any offer that's on the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.88,0:21:01.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不是那样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. It's not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.08,0:21:03.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有个影迷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I have a fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.44,0:21:06.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海瑟 你有很多影迷 我们一直在对你做行销研究\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got plenty of fans. We've been doing marketing research on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.84,0:21:09.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的支持度非常高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are rating right up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.40,0:21:11.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,契斯一直在做新手套设计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got Chase working on a prototype for the new glove.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.84,0:21:13.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 它真的 - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's really... - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.68,0:21:16.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们请他保密 想给你一个惊喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I know, we asked him to keep it as a surprise...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.56,0:21:19.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我可以亲自跟你谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...until you and I could have this conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.48,0:21:22.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴伯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bob...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.44,0:21:25.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,威斯开始写剧本多久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...how long has Wes been working on this script?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.52,0:21:28.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有几个月了 为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. A couple months. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.00,0:21:32.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你开始考虑拍续集后 有发生奇怪的事吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since you've been thinking of making it, has anything funny happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.28,0:21:36.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你是什么意思 - 譬如说奇怪的电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you mean? - Well, like weird phone calls?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.40,0:21:43.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或是做恶梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or nightmares?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.44,0:21:49.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你何不接电话 巴伯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you answer your phone, Bob?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.04,0:21:53.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我花钱雇人帮我接电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. That's what we've got people we pay around here for.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.28,0:21:55.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人接电话吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will someone pick up the damn phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.60,0:22:13.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 不客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks a lot. - You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.04,0:22:17.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.88,0:22:40.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永远不要睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never sleep again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.16,0:22:44.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永远不要睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never sleep again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.44,0:22:49.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生了什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.08,0:22:52.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你该不会让他看电视播出的老电影吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't let him watch the movie on TV, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.40,0:22:55.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电影 他根本没看电视\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Movie? He didn't watch anything on TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.16,0:22:58.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在睡午觉 我听到他大叫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was taking his nap, and I heard him screaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.28,0:23:02.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甜心 你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.12,0:23:06.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雷斯救了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mm-hm. Rex saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.00,0:23:14.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He did?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.60,0:23:22.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雷斯会死吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is Rex going to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.84,0:23:24.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.84,0:23:26.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雷斯不会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rex is not going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.96,0:23:29.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟你保证 甜心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promise you, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.44,0:23:35.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道针线放在厨房的什么地方吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know where the sewing stuff is in the kitchen?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.20,0:23:36.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.32,0:23:40.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要动手术了 好吗 来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll do an operation, okay? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.80,0:23:42.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦医生 茱莉医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Dylan and Dr. Julie.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.32,0:23:47.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,修好了就会像新的一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fix him up good as new, okay? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.68,0:23:59.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,契斯 找你的电话 你太太打来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Chase, you got a call! It's your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.36,0:24:09.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 海瑟 - 契斯 你得赶快回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Heather. - Chase, hi. You better come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.32,0:24:11.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海瑟 我真的很忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Heather, I'm stuck here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.84,0:24:14.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天查克跟泰瑞都没出现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neither Chuck or Terry came in today.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.20,0:24:15.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了 发生了什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why? What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.80,0:24:18.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 契斯 是迪伦 - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Chase, it's Dylan. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.68,0:24:22.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下 我听不清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on. The phone's breaking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.04,0:24:27.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. What's going on with Dylan?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.04,0:24:31.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他发作了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's had some sort of an episode.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.80,0:24:34.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 什么发作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? What kind of episode?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.08,0:24:38.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的行为非常奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was just acting very strangely...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.36,0:24:41.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像是有人在追他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Iike somebody was after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.20,0:24:44.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可怕 我被吓到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's scary. It scared me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.92,0:24:47.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他好像 - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He was acting like.... - Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.16,0:24:50.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他好像佛莱迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like Freddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.12,0:24:55.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海瑟 你又接到骚扰电话了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heather, has there been another phone call?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.76,0:25:00.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么你不告诉我你在设计新手套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chase, why didn't you tell me you were working on a new glove?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.60,0:25:03.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么今天查克跟泰瑞没有去上班\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And why aren't Chuck and Terry at work today?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.68,0:25:05.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别管那些混蛋了 回答我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget those clowns, Heather. Answer me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.84,0:25:07.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是不是又接到骚扰电话了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has there been another phone call today or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.08,0:25:12.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.48,0:25:16.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.24,0:25:19.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我立刻回家 我三小时后到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming home. I'll be there in three hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.12,0:25:23.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丹尼 我得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Danny, I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.88,0:25:26.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 我儿子生病 我得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's up, Chase? - My kid's sick. I gotta fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.16,0:25:46.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太阳一下山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"As soon as the sun was up...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.96,0:25:49.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巫婆要葛丽泰捡木柴生火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the witch made Gretel fetch wood and kindle a fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.48,0:25:51.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要先烤饼干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"We will bake cookies first," she said.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.48,0:25:53.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要加热烤箱跟揉面团\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I've heated the oven and kneaded the dough.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.80,0:25:56.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用手试试火是不是够大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crawl in and see if the fire is blazing high enough now."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.12,0:25:59.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她把葛丽泰朝烤箱雅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As she pushed Gretel toward the oven...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.24,0:26:02.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女巫想关上烤箱的门烧死她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the witch meant to shut the door and bake her once she was inside."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.76,0:26:04.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦 这太暴力了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan, this is so violent.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.28,0:26:07.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道为什么 你喜欢这些愚蠢的童话故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know why you like these stupid old fairy tales.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.08,0:26:09.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请念完\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finish, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.60,0:26:11.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们会害你做恶梦的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're gonna give you nightmares.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.28,0:26:12.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢这个故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like this story.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.24,0:26:18.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葛丽泰知道巫婆想做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"But Gretel guessed what the witch was planning.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.92,0:26:22.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我该怎么办呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I don't know how to get in," Gretel said. "How am I to manage it?"
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.36,0:26:25.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巫婆大叫着"愚蠢的女孩 快点进烤箱"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Stupid girl," shouted the witch rushing up to the oven.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.68,0:26:28.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"烤箱门够大了 看吧 连我都进得去"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"The opening is big enough. See, I can fit myself."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.00,0:26:32.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葛丽泰很快地从后面一推\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then quickly, Gretel came behind and pushed with all her might...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.36,0:26:35.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把巫婆往大火里推\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...plunging the wicked old woman headlong into the flames...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.28,0:26:37.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关上烤箱门后锁紧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...banging the door shut and bolting it tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.48,0:26:39.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巫婆大声叫着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The witch howled."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.28,0:26:41.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.12,0:26:44.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巫婆跟抓狂的猫一样大叫着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"The witch howled like a scalded cat...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.32,0:26:47.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葛丽泰看着她活活被烧死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but Gretel ran and left her there to perish nonetheless.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.64,0:26:50.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她跑去救她哥哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She ran to her brother as fast as she could and flung open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.52,0:26:54.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她哭着说"汉瑟 我们得救了 巫婆死了"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Hansel! Hansel!" she cried, "We're saved! The witch is dead!"
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.36,0:27:00.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该睡觉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time for sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.44,0:27:02.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我他们怎么找到回家的路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say how they find their way back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.76,0:27:03.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明晚再说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tomorrow night.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.52,0:27:05.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 今晚就说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.36,0:27:07.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那真的很重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.20,0:27:13.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦 你知道他们跟着面包屑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan, you know as well as I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.00,0:27:16.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到回家的路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They follow the trail of bread crumbs back to their house.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.56,0:27:19.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的爸爸拼命地亲吻他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then their father covered them with kisses and they were safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.36,0:27:22.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们平安无事 可以好好睡着了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were safe and they could sleep. Now, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.72,0:27:30.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那是什么 - 雷斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is that? - Rex.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.28,0:27:33.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.44,0:27:43.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雷斯把他困在下面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rex keeps him down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.80,0:27:44.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.08,0:27:47.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有爪子的凶老头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mean old man with the claws.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.60,0:27:50.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他趁着我们睡着时想爬上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants to come up while we sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.32,0:27:52.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把脚放在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I keep my feet up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.52,0:27:56.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雷斯把他困在下面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rex keeps him down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.80,0:28:00.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它是我的警卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's my guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.80,0:28:05.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也该找个警卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should have a guard too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.28,0:28:11.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦 下面没有东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan, there's nothing down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.08,0:28:13.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.40,0:28:16.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look. See?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.32,0:28:25.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不在时不是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's different when you're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.04,0:28:27.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,睡觉吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.84,0:28:41.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托别关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.84,0:28:43.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.80,0:28:49.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好睡吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Night, night. Sleep tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.60,0:28:51.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别被虫子咬了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let the bedbugs bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.84,0:28:55.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸会回家吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy coming home?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.80,0:28:57.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他已经在回家的路上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's on his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.80,0:28:59.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会跟着面包屑回家吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He can follow the bread crumbs, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.20,0:29:01.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.96,0:29:11.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果面包屑没先被小鸟吃掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the birds don't eat them first.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.48,0:29:50.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, perfect, perfect, perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.32,0:30:16.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.76,0:30:21.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是角落里的我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's me in the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.80,0:30:28.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是照明灯里的我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's me in the spotlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.68,0:30:31.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,灯光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Light
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.40,0:30:33.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,失去我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Losin' my...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.76,0:30:36.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宗教信仰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...religion.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.08,0:31:02.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈 你害怕吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mommy's scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.92,0:31:05.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.96,0:31:08.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mommy's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.28,0:31:10.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是做了恶梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was just a bad dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.00,0:31:12.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么醒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing out of bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.00,0:31:16.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雷斯叫醒我 它在战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rex woke me up. He was fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.24,0:31:18.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦 快回去睡吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan, go back to sleep, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.32,0:31:21.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我睡不着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sleepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.32,0:31:35.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.56,0:31:40.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是警察 女士 请开门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Police, ma'am. Can you open the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.68,0:31:55.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是海瑟·兰根坎普\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heather Langenkamp?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.00,0:31:57.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.56,0:31:58.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,契斯·波特是你丈夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is Chase Porter your husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.20,0:32:02.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.52,0:32:04.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很遗憾发生了意外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid there was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.76,0:32:07.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来他在开车时睡着了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It appears he fell asleep while driving, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.16,0:32:12.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他 我是说 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he... I mea...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.36,0:32:14.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他受伤了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.36,0:32:17.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕情况要严重多了 女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid it's worse than that, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.20,0:32:28.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他死了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.24,0:32:30.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.72,0:32:37.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们确定真的是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure it's him?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.88,0:32:41.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们找到他的证明 你可以确认一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have his effects. You can confirm from that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.04,0:32:44.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要认尸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna see his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.68,0:32:47.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 女士 你不必那么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you don't, ma'am. It's not necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.00,0:32:51.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要亲眼看到他的尸体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to see it for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.44,0:33:42.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ahem. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.12,0:33:45.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 需要我效劳吗 - 波特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can I help you? - Porter.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.16,0:33:47.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,契斯·波特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chase Porter.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.08,0:33:56.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.48,0:34:05.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,契斯吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said Chase?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.12,0:34:14.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.16,0:34:27.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请在下面签个名 那样子就可以了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just sign here at the bottom. That's all we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.04,0:34:31.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要再看一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to see once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.68,0:34:32.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.08,0:34:35.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能再把床单拉起来一次吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could you lift the sheet again, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.00,0:34:48.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多拉开一些 拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.00,0:34:54.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是怎么一回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.20,0:34:56.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,车子撞得稀烂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a bad wreck, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.76,0:35:00.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会为葬礼把尸体处理好 可是 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The head's gonna be all right for the funeral and all, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.64,0:35:07.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 小姐 你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, lady. You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.72,0:35:11.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你确定 - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You sure? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.16,0:35:20.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么原因造成的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God. What did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.56,0:35:22.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,车子被撞得稀烂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, they said the truck was tore up something awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.88,0:35:25.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以想像他不是 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you can imagine him not being in...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.12,0:35:27.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尸体的状况不太好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...well, exactly top shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.80,0:35:30.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那看起来像是 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It Iooks Iike...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.68,0:35:32.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人抓伤他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...he was clawed.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.84,0:35:35.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.00,0:35:38.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我们不想掀开床单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's why we don't lift the sheet...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.52,0:35:40.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只让你看他的脸 女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...past the face, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.52,0:35:45.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时候看到尸体的惨状 晚上我们会睡不着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes it's what we don't see that gets us through the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.92,0:35:56.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻烦你签个名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, uh, if you'll just sign....
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.48,0:36:05.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上帝是我们的希望跟力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God is our hope and strength...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.60,0:36:09.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在困难时唯一的帮手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...a very present help in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.56,0:36:14.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我们不害怕 即使大地为之震撼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Therefore, we will not fear, though the earth be moved...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.44,0:36:19.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使高山沉入海底\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and though the hills be carried into the midst of the sea...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.08,0:36:23.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使恶浪不断扑来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...though the waters thereof rage and swell...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.40,0:36:29.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使高山崩塌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and though the mountains shake at the tempest of the same...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.68,0:36:47.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.32,0:37:05.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,茱莉 迪伦在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Julie, where's Dylan?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.80,0:37:07.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.28,0:37:15.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help! Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.32,0:37:17.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.28,0:37:22.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 妈妈 - 迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mommy! - Dylan!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.68,0:37:24.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦 抓住妈妈的手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan! Grab Mommy's hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.84,0:37:26.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓紧了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grab it!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.28,0:37:27.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.48,0:37:30.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.80,0:37:42.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快来陪我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.04,0:37:45.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快来陪我 海瑟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay with me, Heather.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.52,0:37:46.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.20,0:37:53.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 迪伦在哪里 - 他没事 他在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's Dylan? Where's Dylan? - He's all right. He's right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.68,0:38:00.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 发生了什么事 - 只是地震\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, what happened? - lt was an earthquake.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.36,0:38:02.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你被震倒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got knocked off your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.28,0:38:04.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实上你受伤了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got a pretty good bump, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.12,0:38:08.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望他能安息 孩子们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May he rest in peace, children...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.20,0:38:10.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你们都能平安回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and may you all get home safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.28,0:38:13.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.04,0:38:31.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果需要我帮忙 海瑟 什么事都可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If there's anything I can do, Heather. Anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.60,0:38:34.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 劳勃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Robert.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.52,0:39:18.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甜心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sweetie?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.16,0:39:24.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蒂娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tina?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.24,0:39:38.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.24,0:39:47.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蒂娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tina?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.80,0:39:51.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蒂娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tina?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.84,0:39:54.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.96,0:40:10.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.32,0:40:11.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宝贝 醒一醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Baby, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.00,0:40:16.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan! Dylan! Dylan, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.32,0:40:21.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.20,0:40:23.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得回去睡觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, sugar. We're gonna go back to bed now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.52,0:40:25.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我在那里睡不着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Mommy, I can't sleep there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.36,0:40:28.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你必须睡觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey, you have to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.32,0:40:34.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一 二 佛莱迪要来抓你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One, two, Freddy's coming for you
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.00,0:40:38.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在哪里听到那个的 你看电影学的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did you hear that? Did you hear that on that movie?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.36,0:40:40.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有接电话吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you answer the phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.16,0:40:44.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦 你在哪里听到那首歌的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan, where did you hear that song?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.04,0:40:46.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我的床上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In my bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.68,0:40:50.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在你的床上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In your bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.68,0:40:53.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我的床单下 孩子们在唱歌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Under my covers. Kids singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.12,0:40:56.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在下面 那个人 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And way down there, the man...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.08,0:40:59.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个很凶的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the mean man....
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.80,0:41:04.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个人在做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that man doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.88,0:41:06.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想爬上床\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trying to get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.00,0:41:09.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想进入我们的世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trying to get up into our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.96,0:41:14.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.92,0:41:43.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is Daddy now?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.20,0:41:51.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸在天堂里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy's in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.96,0:41:55.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他跟上帝在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's with God now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.80,0:42:01.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人得死掉才能见到上帝吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have to die to see God?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.52,0:42:04.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不那么认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.56,0:42:09.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想你必须祈祷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you have to pray.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.00,0:42:13.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟社求救\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And reach out.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.80,0:42:21.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么上帝要让不好的事发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why does God let there be bad things?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.72,0:42:28.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的不知道 甜心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I honestly don't know, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.00,0:42:33.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你睡一下吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please try to get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.08,0:42:45.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能跟我进入我的梦里吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you come with me in my dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.52,0:42:53.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想那种事只会在电影里发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think that only happens in the movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.20,0:43:01.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你回来时 我一定会在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'll always, always, be right here when you get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.88,0:43:04.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我保证不会让任何人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'll make sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.72,0:43:09.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伤害到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that nobody gets your toes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.56,0:44:01.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道他的行为很古怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know his behavior is bizarre.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.76,0:44:04.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但通常他很正常 约翰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he's usually so normal and well adjusted, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.24,0:44:08.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不敢相信这是他 他没有受到任何影响\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just can't believe it's him and not something outside influencing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.88,0:44:12.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许他是处在否认期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or is that how denial works?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.00,0:44:16.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不认为他是处在否认期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whether it is denial, I don't think that's the case here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.00,0:44:20.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你真的很担心迪伦 请医生帮他检查一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, if you're really worried about Dylan, have a doctor check him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.68,0:44:22.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以相信一切都会没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll see. Everything's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.08,0:44:25.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你那么说该不会是要安慰一个发疯的朋友吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not just saying that to help a crazy friend cope, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.92,0:44:30.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦出现的种种行为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything about Dylan's behavior is understandable...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.96,0:44:33.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对一个刚刚失去的孩子来说是很正常的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...for a kid who just lost his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.08,0:44:37.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小孩子该怎么面对 那样的悲剧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How does a child process a thing like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.04,0:44:39.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.24,0:44:43.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也一直无法好好面对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've not been able to process it very well myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.20,0:44:46.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没有发疯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're not crazy, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.68,0:44:49.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到佛莱迪出现在坟墓里感觉真的很疯狂 又跳进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seeing Freddy in that grave feels pretty crazy, and then jumping in.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.28,0:44:52.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你没跳进去 - 在我记忆里是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You didn't jump in. - That's my memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.76,0:44:54.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉真的很真实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seemed absolutely real.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.48,0:44:57.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是感觉 不是事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seemed, not was.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.12,0:45:00.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's....
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.44,0:45:01.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我家族的遗传\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's in my family, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.32,0:45:03.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.08,0:45:06.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的一个近亲在精神病院过世\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A very close relative died in an institution.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.12,0:45:12.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗 如果家族有精神病史可以让一个人发疯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really? Well, if having a screwy family made a person crazy...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.32,0:45:15.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个世界早成了疯人院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the whole world would be one big loony bin.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.80,0:45:20.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有个疯子在骚扰你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a crazed fan after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.48,0:45:23.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那足以把你逼疯 或许对迪伦来说也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what's making you crazy, and probably Dylan too.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.08,0:45:25.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不曾跟他提过那件事 - 孩子们知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I never mentioned that to him. - Kids know.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.20,0:45:29.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们知道有事让父母觉得不安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kids know when something's bugging a parent.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.28,0:45:33.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你仍不知道是谁打电话骚扰你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have no idea who this is calling?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.40,0:45:34.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只知道他是佛莱迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freddy, for all I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.88,0:45:35.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.96,0:45:39.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个男人 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a man...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.48,0:45:43.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或声音低沉的男孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or a boy, with a deep, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.24,0:45:44.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,模仿佛莱迪的声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Freddy voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.44,0:45:48.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长达六个星期 你很讶异 你会梦到佛莱迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six weeks of this, and you're surprised you've got Freddy in your dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.48,0:45:50.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死 被骚扰的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell, Sonny Bono...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.36,0:45:53.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很容易疑神疑鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...after a while began seeing his stalker everywhere, even at Mass.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.64,0:45:55.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.68,0:45:59.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赖特曼报警多少次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And how many times did Letterman call the cops thinking that woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.12,0:46:02.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 宣称那个女人又跑到他的厨房里 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...was down in the kitchen again? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.68,0:46:06.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它会弄得你神经兮兮 如果你 如果你让它那么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, it gets under your skin if you.... If you let it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.32,0:46:13.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的认为迪伦没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really think Dylan's okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.44,0:46:16.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦没事 你没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan's fine. You're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.68,0:46:20.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很难过 但你没事 你也没发疯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're hurting but you're fine, and you're definitely not crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.24,0:46:23.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最担心的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My worst fear...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.60,0:46:27.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是我家里的疯狂基因遗传到我身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that whatever madness is in my family I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.24,0:46:40.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我又遗传给迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That I've passed it on to Dylan.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.40,0:46:50.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.80,0:46:58.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 海瑟 - 迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Heather! - Dylan!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.24,0:47:00.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 确定他没事 约翰 - 你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Make sure he's okay, John! - Yeah, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.12,0:47:02.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你受伤了吗 - 天哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you okay, huh? - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.88,0:47:06.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你受伤了吗 - 迪伦 你没事吧 甜心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you sure? Does anything hurt? - Dylan, are you all right? Honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.92,0:47:08.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you all right? Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.40,0:47:11.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上帝不肯收我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God wouldn't take me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.28,0:47:16.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢 天啊 喔 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God. Oh, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.24,0:47:17.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可思议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.16,0:48:15.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哪位 - 劳勃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - Robert.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.56,0:48:18.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 海瑟 你没事吧 - 我还好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Heather, you doing all right? - Hanging in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.96,0:48:20.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你记得打电话骚扰我的人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know the guy that was calling me all the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.12,0:48:24.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他又来了 他把东西放在我的信箱里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He started again. And he's putting stuff in my mail again.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.60,0:48:28.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个混蛋或许是看到葬礼新闯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The SOB probably read about the funeral in the papers or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.84,0:48:33.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王八蛋 你不该受这种气的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sick mother. It's the last thing you need right now, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.48,0:48:36.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这让我梦到佛莱迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, it's been giving me Freddy nightmares.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.00,0:48:39.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a second, now let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.56,0:48:41.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你梦到佛莱迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're having nightmares about Freddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.16,0:48:43.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我演的佛莱迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As in me?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.36,0:48:47.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不是你 他更可怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it isn't you. He's scarier.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.68,0:48:51.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's....
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.36,0:48:54.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更黑暗邪恶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darker? More evil?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.52,0:48:57.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 你怎么知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.68,0:48:59.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就说我是胡猜的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call it a guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.48,0:49:03.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你猜得很准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty damn good guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.20,0:49:05.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之那是我打电话给你的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway, what I was calling about was...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.80,0:49:07.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看到剧本了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...have you seen any of the script by any chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.92,0:49:10.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 剧本没写好前 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Wes won't show it until he's finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.50,0:49:13.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不会拿给任何人看 他是那么告诉我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least that's what he told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.40,0:49:14.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剧本何时会写好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, when is it gonna be done?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.04,0:49:20.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天知道 他真的很奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the way he's writing, who knows? He's so weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.24,0:49:23.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在葬礼上 问他剧本写得如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I asked him how far he was at the funeral. What did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.32,0:49:27.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说"我只写到 迪伦试着跟上帝接触"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah. "As far as Dylan trying to reach God."
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.64,0:49:30.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天知道那是什么意思 很奇怪吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever that means. Weird, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.96,0:49:33.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把你的孩子写在剧本里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Putting your kid in the script.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.68,0:49:38.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,劳勃 你有做恶梦吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Robert, have you been having nightmares?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.68,0:49:44.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得谈一谈 不能在电话里谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, we need to talk, but not over the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.24,0:49:46.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能去你家吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I come over?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.56,0:49:50.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实上 海瑟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um, actually, Heather, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.64,0:49:53.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天我没空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...today's no good. There's, um....
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.20,0:49:56.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有事 得去处理一下 约明天吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something I have to finish. Tomorrow maybe, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.56,0:50:00.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 明天 我们一早就见面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, tomorrow. But early in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.40,0:50:03.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,劳勃 好好保重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And meanwhile, Robert, take care, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.80,0:50:06.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.88,0:52:32.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.40,0:52:53.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一 二 佛莱迪要来抓你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One, two, Freddy's coming for you
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.48,0:52:57.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.08,0:53:00.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.04,0:53:07.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三 四 锁好你的门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three, four, better lock your door
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.48,0:53:15.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五 六 快去拿十字架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five, six, grab your crucifix
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.88,0:53:23.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,七 八 彻夜不眠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seven, eight, better stay up late
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.60,0:53:27.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦 不要唱那首歌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan. Don't sing that song.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.60,0:53:34.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,九 十 永远不要睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nine, ten, never sleep again
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.12,0:53:38.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.68,0:53:40.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.80,0:53:41.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.44,0:53:48.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永远不要睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never sleep again.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.04,0:53:58.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永远不要睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never sleep again.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.64,0:54:02.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永远不要睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never sleep again.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.12,0:54:21.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永远不要睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never sleep again.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.44,0:54:24.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永远不要睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never sleep again.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.00,0:54:25.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.16,0:54:31.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永远不要睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never sleep again.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.80,0:54:33.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never sleep ag...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.68,0:54:40.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对 - 他是我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes. - Ha-ha-ha. I touched him.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.48,0:55:12.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你家族有癫痴病史吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any history of epilepsy in your family?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.24,0:55:13.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.48,0:55:16.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 糖尿病 - 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Diabetes? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.24,0:55:17.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生过能够刺激他的事吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was there a trigger event?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.92,0:55:20.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,譬如外伤或休克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trauma, shock?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.84,0:55:23.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没让他看你演过的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You haven't shown him any of the films you've made, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.92,0:55:25.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怖电影吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The horror stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.92,0:55:28.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他爸爸刚刚过世\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His father just passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.80,0:55:30.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.40,0:55:32.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm convinced...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.76,0:55:37.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些电影会导致不稳定的孩子 出现行为异常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...those films can tip an unstable child over the edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.80,0:55:39.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不稳定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unstable?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.76,0:55:43.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦不是不稳定 他只是难过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan's not unstable. He's just upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.24,0:55:45.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过几天我们会知道答案的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll run tests and we'll know in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.40,0:55:48.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚他一定要留在这里吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does he have to stay here overnight?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.40,0:55:50.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.84,0:55:56.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪葛拉菲医生 急诊室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Degraffey, ER.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.36,0:55:59.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还发生了什么事 是我们该知道的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything more happen we need to know about?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.04,0:56:02.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,譬如说呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.96,0:56:06.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时候小孩子说的话 幻想的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes what a child says or fantasizes...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.84,0:56:08.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能告诉我们是什么刺激了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...will give a clue to what ails him.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.96,0:56:12.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他意识不清时说了什么话吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did he say anything while he was still lucid?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.80,0:56:20.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.48,0:56:29.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爱因侯医生 237线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Einhorn, line 237.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.76,0:56:31.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他到底是怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do we have here?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.84,0:56:33.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在还无法判断\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too soon to know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.16,0:56:37.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初期症状显示应该是儿童精神分裂症\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The early symptoms point to childhood schizophrenia.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.48,0:56:44.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦 你能听到我说话吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.20,0:56:48.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦 你得抗拒到底\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan, you have to fight it...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.48,0:56:51.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不论是什么东西在追你 你得回到我身边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...whatever it is that's after you, and you gotta come back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.88,0:56:54.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一个人是办不到的 你听到了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't make it alone. Do you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.84,0:56:59.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你能听到我说话 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you can hear me,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.32,0:57:01.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么你能告诉我该怎么做能让你觉得安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then you can tell me what you need to feel safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.44,0:57:10.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雷斯 你要找它吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rex? Is that what you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.00,0:57:15.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雷斯在家里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well.... Well, Rex is at home...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.96,0:57:18.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也该回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and that's where you should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.64,0:57:21.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你得好起来他们才会让你回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you gotta get better before they'll let you come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.48,0:57:22.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你懂吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.80,0:57:26.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Home.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.32,0:57:29.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,家 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Home. Home, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.20,0:57:31.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你回家 甜心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's where I want you, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.52,0:57:34.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们离家不远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you know, we're not that far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.44,0:57:37.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 就在那边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look. Look, right out there...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.56,0:57:40.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过了高速公路说是我们家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...past the freeway is our home.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.04,0:57:42.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But to get there...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.40,0:57:45.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得离开现在那个地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you have to come out from where you are...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.60,0:57:49.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们才会让你回家找雷斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...so that they'll let you come home to Rex...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.08,0:57:51.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.20,0:57:54.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你该吃药了 小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time for your medicine, cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.56,0:57:58.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.04,0:58:00.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能帮他入眠的药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something to help him sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.60,0:58:02.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.72,0:58:08.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 非常好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you go. Yeah, it's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.40,0:58:15.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.52,0:58:18.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一 二 很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One, two, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.96,0:58:20.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 真是个好孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good! Attaboy!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.88,0:58:22.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,睡一下吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, now lie down and take a little nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.04,0:58:25.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也该休息一下 他会没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should get some rest too. He's going to be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.84,0:58:29.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要做一些检查 然后你就可以回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna do some tests and then you can come back later.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.96,0:58:32.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻烦你把那边拉起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you get that other side, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.88,0:58:34.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我带了一些他的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I grabbed his things.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.84,0:58:37.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是他最喜欢的睡衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are his favorite pajamas here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.68,0:58:42.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甜心 我得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey, I've gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.64,0:58:44.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你 迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you, Dylan.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.96,0:58:47.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记住我说过的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.68,0:58:50.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会好好照顾他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll take care of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.32,0:58:58.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.12,0:59:47.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,醒一醒 小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake up, lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.84,0:59:51.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在不能失控\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't Iose it now!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.88,1:00:10.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加州理工学院的地质学家估计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seismologists at Caltech have counted...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.44,1:00:12.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目前余震超过三百次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...over 300 of the tremblers so far.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.40,1:00:14.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然多数震度轻微到我们无法感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Though most were too faint for us to feel...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.68,1:00:17.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近本市发生了七次有感地震\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...seven have shaken our community in the last two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.52,1:00:20.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科学家推测可能有盲断层\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now scientists are speculating there might be an unknown fault...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.04,1:00:23.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通过洛杉矶下方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...running beneath Los Angeles. A fault that could...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.12,1:00:36.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是英格朗家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi. You've reached the Englund residence.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.88,1:00:38.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们出城去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're out of town right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.48,1:00:43.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以留言 但我们过一阵子才会回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can leave a message if you wish, but, uh, we'll be gone for some time.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.76,1:01:11.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也希望能告诉你剧本的进度 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish I could tell you where this script was going. The fact is I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.32,1:01:15.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚上我梦到故事 天亮后将它写下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I dream a scene at night. I write it in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.68,1:01:18.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beyond that, your guess is as good as mine where it's going.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.28,1:01:20.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我目前故事的发展\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, at least tell me what it's about so far.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.52,1:01:24.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 咖啡 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Coffee. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.76,1:01:26.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以告诉你 目前我做了什么恶梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can tell you what the nightmare's about so far.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.12,1:01:31.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,故事的主角是这个恶鬼 不论你要怎么称呼它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's about this entity, whatever you want to call it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.28,1:01:33.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它非常老了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's old. It's very old.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.60,1:01:37.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它以不同的形式存在于不同的时代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's existed in different forms in different times.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.96,1:01:40.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它唯一不变的特质就是它存在的目的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only thing that stays the same is what it lives for.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.64,1:01:42.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.68,1:01:45.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它要杀害无辜的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the murder of innocence.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.16,1:01:49.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还在谈剧本的事 对吧 威斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is still a script we're talking about, right, Wes?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.80,1:01:54.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 我想它应该是仍在发生中的恶梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, I sort of think of it as a nightmare in progress.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.12,1:01:58.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这个仍在发生中的恶梦 这个恶鬼有弱点吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, in this nightmare in progress then, does this thing have any weaknesses?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.92,1:02:00.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时候它会被抓住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it can be captured sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.08,1:02:03.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被抓住 该怎么做呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captured? How?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.44,1:02:05.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被说故事的人或其他力量抓住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By storytellers, of all things.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.48,1:02:07.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,偶尔 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.42,1:02:10.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会想到一个好故事抓住恶鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}every so often they imagine a story good enough to sort of catch its essence...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.88,1:02:14.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把恶鬼关在故事里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and then for a while it's held prisoner in the story.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.56,1:02:18.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 就像是瓶中精灵 - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Like the genie in the bottle. - Exactly. Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.04,1:02:20.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,问题是故事会死去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the problem comes when the story dies.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.12,1:02:22.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原因非常多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That can happen in a lot of ways.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.68,1:02:24.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它变得太老套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can get too familiar to people...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.64,1:02:26.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或是有人灌水 想把它拿去卖钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or somebody waters it down to make it an easier sell.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.16,1:02:31.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或是它被完全禁止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, or maybe it's just so upsetting to society that it's banned outright.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.00,1:02:35.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,故事死去时 恶鬼能获得自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However it happens when the story dies, the evil is set free.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.68,1:02:40.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说佛莱迪是古老恶鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're saying Freddy is this ancient thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.80,1:02:43.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 现代版的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. Current version.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.80,1:02:46.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十年来他在《半夜鬼上床》系列\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And for 10 years, he's been held captive pretty much...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.68,1:02:50.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被描绘成佛莱迪的形象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...as Freddy in the Nightmare on Elm Street series...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.32,1:02:52.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在电影系列结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but now that the films have ended...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.84,1:02:54.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的精灵从瓶子里逃出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the genie's out of the bottle, Heather.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.68,1:02:58.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是恶梦告诉我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what the nightmares are telling me and that's what I'm writing.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.64,1:03:01.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果佛莱迪从你的剧本里逃走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, if Freddy is loose in your script...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.04,1:03:03.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会去哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...where's he gonna go?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.48,1:03:06.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去另一个时代 换另一种形式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another age? Another form?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.24,1:03:09.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 梦不是要他那么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. That's not what the dreams have him doing though.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.68,1:03:11.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他要做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.28,1:03:14.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在他习惯自己是佛莱迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, see, he's sort of gotten used to being Freddy now...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.72,1:03:19.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他喜欢我们的时空 他决定跨过界线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and he likes our time and space, so he's decided to cross over.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.72,1:03:21.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离开电影 进入我们的真实世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out of films, into our reality.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.36,1:03:28.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人可以阻止他吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't there somebody who can stop him?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.76,1:03:31.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实上在梦里有一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, there is a person in the dreams...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.04,1:03:35.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她可以说扮演着守门人的角色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...sort of a gatekeeper, so to speak.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.92,1:03:40.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佛莱迪得先过她那一关才能进入我们的世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody that Freddy has to get by before he can come through into our world.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.76,1:03:43.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个人就是你 海瑟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That person's you, Heather.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.28,1:03:46.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's me? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.48,1:03:47.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But why me?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.88,1:03:50.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,认真地想起来 这的确有道理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, dramatically speaking, it makes perfect sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.56,1:03:52.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毕竟你饰演南希\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You played Nancy, after all.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.24,1:03:54.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是第一个羞辱他的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were the first to humiliate him, defeat him.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.40,1:03:57.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是南希 不是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was Nancy, Wes, it's not me.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.36,1:04:00.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你给了南希力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but it was you that gave Nancy her strength...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.36,1:04:03.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要逃脱 他得先过你那一关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...so in order to get out he's got to come through you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.60,1:04:07.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会试着攻击你的弱点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it's inevitable that he's gonna try to do that at your most vulnerable points.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.68,1:04:14.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 威斯 你知道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God, Wes. Did you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.88,1:04:17.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是剧本\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heather, it was a script.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.24,1:04:20.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是梦 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a dream. I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.68,1:04:24.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很清楚事情没那么简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know damn well it's more than that now.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.12,1:04:26.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,威斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wes.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.80,1:04:29.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,威斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wes.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.20,1:04:30.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们该怎么阻止他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can we stop him?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.44,1:04:35.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想阻止他的唯一方式就是再拍一部电影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think the only way to stop him is to make another movie.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.84,1:04:39.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会努力把剧本写完\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear I'll stay by this computer and write until I finish the script...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.08,1:04:44.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但在我写完剧本时 你得做出选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but when that time comes, you're gonna have to make a choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.60,1:04:47.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,选择 什么选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Choice? What kind of choice?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.76,1:04:50.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要不要最后一次 饰演南希\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whether or not you're willing to play Nancy one last time.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.88,1:05:02.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(儿童疾病研究)
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.24,1:05:07.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(美国心理学家)
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.68,1:05:20.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"许多儿童精神分裂症的症状\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Many of the symptoms of childhood schizophrenia...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.48,1:05:25.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都导因于儿童 出现睡眠不足的问题"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...are duplicated in children suffering from sleep deprivation. "
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.52,1:05:34.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"睡眠不足会产生出神症状\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Sleep deprivation can produce trance-like states...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.20,1:05:36.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机械式动作"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... mechanical behavior.... "
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.84,1:05:38.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sleepy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.88,1:05:40.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雷斯把我吵醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rex woke me u p.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.80,1:05:43.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它在对抗有爪子的坏老头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was fighting the mean old man with the claws.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.04,1:05:46.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不知道是谁打电话骚扰你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have no idea who this is calling?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.60,1:05:47.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只知道是佛莱迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freddy, for all I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.04,1:05:49.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我演的佛莱迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As in me?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.32,1:05:51.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不是你 他更可怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it isn't you. He's scarier.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.12,1:05:54.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 更黑暗邪恶 - 你怎么知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Darker? More evil? - How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.88,1:05:56.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他决定跨过界线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's decided to cross over...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.76,1:05:58.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离开电影 进入我们的真实世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...out of films, into our reality.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.16,1:06:02.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永远不要睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never sleep again.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.16,1:06:18.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怖电影界今天发生了悲剧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world of horror films suffered its own terror today...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.52,1:06:21.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两位好莱坞最佳特效人员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...as two of Hollywood's best-known special-effects technicians...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.88,1:06:24.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被发现陈尸在空地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... were found dead in a vacant field.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.48,1:06:26.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,泰伦斯范斯坦跟查尔斯威尔森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Terrance Feinstein and Charles Wilson...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.84,1:06:30.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在为佛莱迪·克鲁格系列电影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... two special-effects artists reputedly working on a top-secret project...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.92,1:06:33.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,制作单位进行一项超机密计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... for the makers of the Freddy Krueger films...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.44,1:06:36.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天早上被发现遭人杀害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... were found brutally slashed to death early this morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.08,1:06:48.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佛莱迪的手套不见了 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freddy's glove was missing,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.01,1:06:49.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警察怀疑凶案发生的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and police are speculating the murders were the result...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.44,1:06:54.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是因为两天前一位小偷行窃失手痛下毒手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... of a botched theft, which apparently took place two days ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.60,1:06:57.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警方一直没找到凶器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At this point the murder weapon has not been found...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.12,1:07:36.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.88,1:08:01.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想念我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss me?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.64,1:08:29.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南希\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nancy.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.64,1:08:58.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Dylan. Dylan!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.44,1:09:01.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在不是访客时间 你必须了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are no visiting hours. You must understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.48,1:09:04.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我不了解 我是他保姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I don't understand. I'm his babysitter.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.92,1:09:08.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是他们家的朋友 我只要看他一眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a close friend of the family, damn it. I just need to see him for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.12,1:09:11.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 就一分钟 拜托 - 你得了解 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sixty seconds. Come on. - You have to understand...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.80,1:09:14.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不能让你见他 - 茱莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...I can't let you see him. - Julie?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.72,1:09:16.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 海瑟 - 你在做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Heather. - What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.12,1:09:20.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.76,1:09:23.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我梦到关于迪伦的恶梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had this terrible dream about Dylan.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.76,1:09:26.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我非来见他不可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had to come and see him.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.92,1:09:29.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定以为我疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must think I'm crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.28,1:09:33.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我不会那么想 他还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I don't. Is he all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.36,1:09:35.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不让我进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, they wouldn't let me in.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.36,1:09:38.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兰根坎普小姐 在这家医院中 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Langenkamp, I'm afraid there are no evening visiting hours...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.92,1:09:40.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 晚上没有访客时间 - 他还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...in intensive care. - ls he all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.92,1:09:43.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦吗 他很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan? He's holding well.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.76,1:09:45.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前他出了一些问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Earlier, he had some problems.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.56,1:09:47.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们让他使用氧气帐篷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's in an oxygen tent just now.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.56,1:09:48.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.96,1:09:50.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海瑟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heather.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.40,1:09:54.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来你发生了一些意外 兰根坎普小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seems we've had an accident, Miss Langenkamp.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.28,1:09:55.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能让我看一下吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.32,1:10:00.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你伤得不轻 你怎么受伤的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those are nasty cuts. How did you get them?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.08,1:10:03.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在地震中受伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It happened in the earthquake.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.12,1:10:05.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跌倒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I fell.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.60,1:10:07.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得见迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to see Dylan.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.20,1:10:11.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下 先让我们帮你治疗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a moment. First, let's see about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.08,1:10:18.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果再靠近手腕几寸 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If these had been a few inches nearer the wrist....
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.20,1:10:21.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底是怎么受伤的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you say you cut yourself on?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.48,1:10:23.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当时发生地震 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was the earthquake, it was dark, I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.92,1:10:26.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是新伤口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But these look quite fresh.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.88,1:10:30.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 我在今晚地震中受伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are. It happened in tonight's earthquake.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.52,1:10:34.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十五分钟前发生地震\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It happened just 15 minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.80,1:10:35.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定感觉到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must have felt it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.80,1:10:40.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还好这里没感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guess we lucked out over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.20,1:10:48.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你儿子很怕一个男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your son is apparently terrified of a man...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.60,1:10:51.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他认为那个人 要从他的床下爬出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...someone he thinks is going to come out of his bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.36,1:10:55.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,护士听到他自言自语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of the nurses heard him talking to himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.48,1:10:58.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道那个人是谁吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have any idea who that man is, Miss Langenkamp?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.48,1:11:02.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我忘记把恐龙玩偶雷斯带来给他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I forgot to bring his dinosaur, Rex.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.52,1:11:05.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它能阻止佛莱迪不会爬上他的 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He keeps Freddy from coming up out of his...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.56,1:11:08.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,床\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.80,1:11:11.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你电影里的那个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man from your films?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.20,1:11:15.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佛莱迪·克鲁格 有爪子的那个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freddy Krueger? With the claws?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.12,1:11:18.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他害怕那个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that who he's afraid of?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.44,1:11:27.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你让你的儿子看你拍的电影 对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have let your child see your films, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.60,1:11:30.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个孩子都知道佛莱迪是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every kid knows who Freddy is.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.20,1:11:33.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就跟圣诞老人或金刚一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's like Santa Claus or King Kong or....
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.68,1:11:37.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.04,1:11:40.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很高兴能跟你谈 兰根坎普小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...interesting talking with you, Miss Langenkamp.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.24,1:11:43.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望你能了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.64,1:11:46.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是担心你儿子的健康\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My concerns are simply for the welfare of your son.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.52,1:12:10.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.56,1:12:53.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.32,1:12:58.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甜心 你不该那么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey! You shouldn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.60,1:13:00.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太迟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.00,1:13:05.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我差一步就能成功 海瑟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm almost there, Heather.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.28,1:13:07.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差一步就能成功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost there!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.56,1:13:14.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.28,1:13:16.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.48,1:13:17.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 救命 - 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Help! - Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.60,1:13:25.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.96,1:13:27.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别让她进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep her right there!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.20,1:13:29.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们无法再压制他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't hold him much longer, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.24,1:13:32.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 全剂量麻醉药 快点 - 这里没有那么多药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Full anesthetic. Stat! - We don't have that here, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.00,1:13:36.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要帮他动刀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No anesthetic, you say. Screw it then, I'm going in.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.40,1:13:38.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不喜欢这个小混蛋一肚子坏水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little booger's full of something I don't like.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.84,1:13:40.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得帮他开肠剖肚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get him open.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.76,1:13:42.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,砍掉他的邪恶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut this evil out of him.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.96,1:13:45.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.56,1:13:49.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 葛洛莉亚 - 他抢走我的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gloria! - He's got my baby?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.52,1:13:50.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谁 - 佛莱迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who? - Freddy!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.72,1:13:52.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁 佛莱迪·克鲁格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freddy? Who? Freddy Krueger or something?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.80,1:13:54.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生了什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.36,1:13:57.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佛莱迪抢走我儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My baby, Freddy's got my baby. He's got my Dylan.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.24,1:13:59.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兰根坎普小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Langenkamp. Miss Langenkamp.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.44,1:14:02.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我建议你回家休息一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suggest you go home and get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.44,1:14:03.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你儿子没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your son is fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.08,1:14:06.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们送他到楼下 做进一步检查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's been taken downstairs for further testing.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.52,1:14:07.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚刚他还在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he was just here.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.92,1:14:11.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他刚才在这里 你睡着了 我们将他送走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was here. You fell asleep. We took him.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.00,1:14:13.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你似乎很累\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You looked so exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.92,1:14:15.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不想吵醒你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frankly, we didn't want to wake you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.96,1:14:18.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且茱莉陪着他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, the young woman Julie is with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.96,1:14:20.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是他的保姆 对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's his babysitter, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.12,1:14:23.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信我 没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Believe me, everything is fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.64,1:14:27.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything's not fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.32,1:14:30.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死 通知警卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn. Call security.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.80,1:14:38.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警卫注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Security, code yellow to Pediatric Testing.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.56,1:14:41.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小儿科检验处黄色通报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Security, code yellow to Pediatric Testing.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.64,1:14:46.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是管制区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, this is a restricted area.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.76,1:14:48.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你有通行证吗 - 去你的通行证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you have a pass? - Screw your pass!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.72,1:14:50.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系 兰根坎普小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right. Miss Langenkamp.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.68,1:14:53.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他在哪里 - 冷静点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where is he? - Just stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.48,1:14:55.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的小宝贝还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell us how our little boy is doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.44,1:14:58.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实上他很好 几分钟前他醒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's fine, actually. Uh, he just came around about 10 minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.08,1:15:02.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他有急性睡眠不足的现象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, he seems to be suffering from acute sleep deprivation.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.72,1:15:04.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想她故意不让他好好睡上一个晚上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think she lets him get sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.84,1:15:07.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么 他在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you saying? Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.40,1:15:08.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海瑟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heather.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.48,1:15:13.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人想见你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got someone here who wants to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.00,1:15:15.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,茱莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Julie.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.28,1:15:19.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.28,1:15:26.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甜心 迪伦 你没事吧 儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, honey. Oh, Dylan. Are you okay, champ?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.28,1:15:31.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能去找雷斯吗 坏人越来越接近了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we go get Rex now? The bad man's getting awful close.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.40,1:15:34.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.28,1:15:37.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们立刻去找雷斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna go get Rex right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.28,1:15:39.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕迪伦必须待在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid Dylan should stay here...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.40,1:15:42.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等我们查出他的病因 兰根坎普小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...until we know what's causing these episodes, Miss Langenkamp.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.24,1:15:46.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信你会了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure you understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.52,1:15:50.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.16,1:15:57.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'll tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.52,1:15:59.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去把雷斯带过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna go home and get Rex for you right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.92,1:16:02.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们家离这里不远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know that home isn't far from here, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.56,1:16:04.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 过高速公路就到了 - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Right across the freeway. - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.16,1:16:09.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很快就回来 茱莉会陪你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I won't be gone long. And Julie, she's gonna stay right here with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.28,1:16:11.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. You bet.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.56,1:16:15.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你快一点 我好想睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry up, please. I'm sleepy.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.44,1:16:21.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我发誓 真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promise. Cross my heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.48,1:16:25.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦 在妈妈回来前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, Dylan, until Mommy gets back...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.60,1:16:29.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不论你做什么事 千万别睡着了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...whatever you do, don't fall asleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.48,1:16:33.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,茱莉 别让他离开你的视线范围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Julie, don't let him out of your sight.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.68,1:16:38.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生了什么事 你的头发变白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on here? Your hair's turning gray.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.32,1:16:42.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,茱莉 让他保持清醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Julie, keep him awake!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.68,1:16:45.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,懂吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.24,1:16:52.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能跟我们来一下吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, miss, would you come with us for a second?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.84,1:16:54.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.24,1:16:57.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们想做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell do you think you're doing? Get your hands off me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.60,1:17:02.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你介意吗 这到底是怎么一回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you mind? What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.16,1:17:07.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只想谈一下 为了迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a quick word, Miss Langenkamp, for Dylan's sake.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.20,1:17:16.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天真的很混乱 对吧 兰根坎普小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we've had an exciting day, haven't we, Miss Langenkamp?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.88,1:17:29.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 一 二 三 - 你赢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- One, two, three. One, two, three. - You won.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.08,1:17:43.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能暂时到外面等一下吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you mind stepping outside for just one moment, miss?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.56,1:17:46.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要 你想做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As a matter of fact, I would. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.56,1:17:49.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要帮他打针 让他睡着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just a little shot to see that he gets some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.08,1:17:51.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 他妈妈特别交代过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. His mother specifically said...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.20,1:17:54.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我说不行 - 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I said no. - Do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.24,1:18:00.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 噢! - 好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ow! - All done.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.76,1:18:02.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他很快就会睡着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll be asleep in no time.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.56,1:18:05.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 放开我的手 - 大混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Would you mind letting go of my arm? - You bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.32,1:18:10.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能那么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! You can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.12,1:18:18.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道那里面装了什么 你知道这里面装了什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I know what's in that one. Do you have any idea what's in this one?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.16,1:18:21.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我扎中你时会发生什么事呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or what's gonna happen to you when I stick you with it?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.92,1:18:23.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会动手的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I will.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.76,1:18:32.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 迪伦 我要你保持清醒 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no. No, no, no, Dylan. I want you to stay awake, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.12,1:18:36.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,张开眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to keep your eyes open for me, okay? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.76,1:18:38.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兰根坎普小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Langenkamp...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.84,1:18:43.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的家族有滥用药物史吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...has there been any use of recreational drugs in your family?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.12,1:18:47.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 或是精神病史\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Or any history of mental disturbance?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.52,1:18:52.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你到底想问什么 - 别误会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you asking? - Please, don't take it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.32,1:18:55.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果真的是那样 极有可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If there was, there's a good chance...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.48,1:18:58.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦出现了遗传性健康问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Dylan could be suffering from something passed down to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.36,1:19:04.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一直被幻觉所扰吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you been suffering from any delusional events, Miss Langenkamp?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.08,1:19:12.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你电影里的这个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This man from your films...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.00,1:19:14.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佛莱迪·克鲁格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Freddy Krueger....
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.76,1:19:18.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一直都能看到他吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you been seeing him?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.68,1:19:19.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.96,1:19:27.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 快把钥匙拿过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello! - Would you get those keys?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.92,1:19:30.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦 保持清醒 张开眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan, I want you to stay awake. Come on, stay awake.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.72,1:19:33.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 张开眼睛 - 妈妈在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Keep your eyes open for me, okay? - Where's Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.08,1:19:35.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她 马上回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'll be back. Now, stay awake.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.04,1:19:41.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有些药物跟治疗方法 兰根坎普小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are drugs and treatments, Miss Langenkamp.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.52,1:19:46.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以安排迪伦到寄养家庭暂时待一阵子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could put Dylan in foster care for a short while...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.64,1:19:49.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们好好帮你做检查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...just long enough to run some tests on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.56,1:19:52.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,张开眼睛 加油 保持清醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just keep your eyes open. Do that for me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.20,1:19:55.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你保持清醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Stay awake. Stay awake for me, Dylan.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.24,1:19:59.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你保持清醒 张开眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to stay awake, okay? Stay awake. Keep your eyes open.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.72,1:20:04.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦 怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.60,1:20:09.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,茱莉 在你的后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Julie, behind you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.48,1:20:18.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing there.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.52,1:20:20.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦 怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.84,1:20:24.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦 别闹了 你吓到我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan, stop it. You're scaring me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.32,1:20:27.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.04,1:20:31.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要见我儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want my son out of here, right now!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.60,1:20:34.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very well.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.24,1:20:36.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等我们拿到文件后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As soon as we can gather the appropriate papers.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.88,1:20:39.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不了解 如果迪伦睡着了 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't understand! If Dylan falls asleep...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.16,1:20:43.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.92,1:20:56.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.28,1:20:57.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦 快离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan, get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.48,1:20:59.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点 迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get... Dylan!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.32,1:21:13.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦 你帮猫咪剥过皮吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Dylan, ever play skin the cat?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.20,1:21:15.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aah! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.24,1:21:27.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}FREDDY. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.36,1:21:39.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.56,1:21:41.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,茱莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Julie!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.24,1:21:52.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雷斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rex!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.44,1:21:54.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生了什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.68,1:21:58.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能进去 退后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, miss, you can't go in there. No, get back.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.52,1:22:01.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下 你不能进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, wait, wait. You can't...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.52,1:22:07.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警卫注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Code yellow to Pediatric Testing.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.96,1:22:10.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小儿科检验处黄色通报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Code yellow to Pediatric Testing.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.92,1:22:12.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,茱莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Julie.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.12,1:22:19.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我儿子在哪里 他在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's my son? Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.44,1:22:21.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看到我儿子了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you seen my son?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.04,1:22:25.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 刚刚他还在这里 - 那孩子吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He was just here. He was just.... - The boy?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.52,1:22:27.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不可能会跑掉 我们帮他注射安眠药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No way he's going anywhere. He's been heavily sedated.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.16,1:22:29.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不可能保持清醒乱跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He doesn't have to be awake to be on his feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.12,1:22:32.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么? - 他在梦游 你这个白痴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - He sleepwalks, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.36,1:22:36.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他有办法离开医院 该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's fully capable of walking out of this hospital! Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.04,1:22:50.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 约翰 我需要你帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello? - John, It's Heather. I need your help!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.80,1:22:54.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 为什么 发生了什么事 - 迪伦离开医院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why? What happened? - John, Dylan's run away from the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.88,1:22:57.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道他是不是在梦游\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if he's wandering around or headed for the house...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.64,1:23:00.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想佛莱迪在追他 我知道这听起来很疯狂 可是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but I think Freddy's after him! I know that sounds so crazy, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.92,1:23:02.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说的对 真的很疯狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right. That sounds crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.12,1:23:06.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.08,1:23:15.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.16,1:23:17.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.76,1:23:19.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我们家离这里不远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know that home isn't far from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.88,1:23:20.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Dylan!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.88,1:23:23.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在高速公路对面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right across the freeway.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.56,1:23:37.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.76,1:23:46.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.52,1:24:06.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克鲁格 你这个混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Krueger, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.76,1:24:09.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快来抓我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take me!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.00,1:24:30.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.52,1:24:45.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 - 发生了什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you okay? - Hey, man, is she okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.88,1:24:54.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我儿子在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My son is out here!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.52,1:24:58.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦 放开我 迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan! Dylan! Leave me alone! Dylan!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.44,1:25:03.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.52,1:25:26.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.56,1:25:39.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 迪伦 - 对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dylan? Aah! - Oh, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.64,1:25:41.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生了什么事 你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to you? Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.56,1:25:43.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事 你有看到迪伦吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fine. Have you seen Dylan? Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.88,1:25:48.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放轻松 冷静点 他在那边发生了什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it easy. Take it easy. Relax. He's right there. What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.88,1:25:52.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦 天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Dylan! Oh, God! You're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.44,1:25:56.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生了什么事 海瑟 到底发生了什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on, Heather? What in the world happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.72,1:25:59.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我知道契斯为什么会死掉 - 你是什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I know how Chase really died. - What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.08,1:26:02.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是佛莱迪·克鲁格干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fred Krueger did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.04,1:26:07.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.16,1:26:18.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看到他了 对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saw him, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.92,1:26:21.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来抓你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming for you
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.28,1:26:23.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南希 我们到外面谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nancy, let's go outside.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.68,1:26:25.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 迪伦 - 他会没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dylan. - He'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.36,1:26:28.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我 马上回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.72,1:26:53.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底发生了什么事 南希\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is going on, Nancy?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.08,1:26:56.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么你要叫我南希 约翰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you calling me Nancy, John?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.12,1:26:59.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么你要叫我约翰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you calling me John?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.24,1:27:09.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南希 振作一点 别把自己跟那孩子逼疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nancy, pull yourself together before you make yourself and that kid nuts.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.68,1:27:17.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.80,1:27:20.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你有打电话给劳勃吗 - 劳勃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Would you call Robert? - Robert?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.32,1:27:21.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,劳勃英格朗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Robert Englund.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.28,1:27:24.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,饰演佛莱迪的演员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, the guy who plays Freddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.96,1:27:26.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么佛莱迪 - 佛莱迪·克鲁格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Freddy who? - Freddy Krueger!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.16,1:27:31.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南希 佛莱迪死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nancy, Freddy's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.84,1:27:40.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要乱发疯 就跟你妈一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, don't start losing it like your mother did.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.44,1:27:42.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你 甜心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.12,1:27:46.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别忘了那一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't forget that.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.68,1:27:58.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也爱你 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you too, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.76,1:28:30.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好休息一下 南希 拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, get yourself some rest, Nancy. Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.92,1:29:02.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.52,1:29:09.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一 二 佛莱迪要来抓你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One, two, Freddy's coming for you
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.04,1:29:13.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.64,1:29:20.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差一点就成功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost there!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.56,1:29:24.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸 我跟你讲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, Daddy, I've got a proposition for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.76,1:29:26.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要去找这件事的元凶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna go and get the guy who did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.08,1:29:29.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到那里逮捕他 等我将他带出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I want you to be there to arrest him when I bring him out, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.36,1:29:33.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南希 告诉我是谁干的 我会抓到他 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nancy, just tell me who did it. I'll go get him, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.64,1:29:35.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是佛莱迪·克鲁格干的 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fred Krueger did it, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.76,1:29:36.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.68,1:30:12.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦的安眠药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan's sleeping pills?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.40,1:30:15.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我他们怎么找到回家的路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say how they find their way back home.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.96,1:30:18.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那真的很重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's important.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.44,1:30:22.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,面包屑 迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bread crumbs. Dylan.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.72,1:30:26.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太迟了 海瑟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too late, Heather.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.68,1:30:30.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太迟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too Iate.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.44,1:30:36.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.12,1:30:43.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.24,1:31:31.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加入你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Join you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.08,1:31:35.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你告诉我该怎么加入你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've given me a way to join you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.00,1:31:56.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.40,1:32:26.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.84,1:33:34.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.48,1:33:36.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.20,1:33:46.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.60,1:34:13.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.84,1:34:17.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差一点就成功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.12,1:35:00.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她越深入研究\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"The more she read...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.72,1:35:03.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,越了解拿在她自己手上的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the more she realized what she had in her hands...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.44,1:35:07.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是她的生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...was nothing more or less than her life itself.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.40,1:35:10.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她经历跟思索过的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That everything she had experienced and thought...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.84,1:35:12.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都写在剧本里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... was bound within these pages. "
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.96,1:35:18.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是电影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"There was no movie.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.56,1:35:20.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实上这是 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was only...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.44,1:35:21.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她的人生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... her life. "
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.32,1:35:24.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是我 - 迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's just me. - Dylan!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.92,1:35:32.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 - 没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you okay? Are you all right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.24,1:35:35.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那个人在哪里 - 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay. Where's the man? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.40,1:35:37.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他抓到我 后来又放了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had me, but then he let me go.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.92,1:35:42.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来见见你的主宰吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meet your maker.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.20,1:35:56.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮小鬼挑个宠物吧 混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pick a pet for the rug rat, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.28,1:36:09.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.36,1:36:14.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 妈妈 - 快离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mommy! - Get out of here, Dylan!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.64,1:36:37.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take this!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.32,1:36:53.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快过来 宝贝 我有一些姜饼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here, my pretty. I've got some gingerbread for you!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.44,1:36:55.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 迪伦 快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Dylan, run!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.76,1:37:13.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.76,1:37:15.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓到你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotcha! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.36,1:37:22.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.52,1:37:27.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 妈妈 - 妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mommy! - Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.84,1:37:32.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你妈妈在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, where's your mommy, piglet, huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.08,1:37:37.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一 二 佛莱迪要来抓你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One, two, Freddy's coming for you
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.40,1:38:33.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.76,1:38:35.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.04,1:38:48.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.84,1:39:02.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.08,1:39:15.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来爸爸这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come to Papa!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.44,1:39:22.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要吃掉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gonna eat you up.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.84,1:39:41.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.48,1:40:06.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪伦 快离开那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan! Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.00,1:40:08.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey! - Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.80,1:40:37.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}FREDDY. No!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.32,1:40:55.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他关起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Push him in!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.48,1:41:05.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用力谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Push!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.52,1:41:33.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.04,1:42:08.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.20,1:42:16.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甜心 甜心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my... Honey. Honey.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.88,1:42:20.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.04,1:42:24.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得救了 坏人死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're saved. The witch is dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.32,1:42:27.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈亲吻着他 他们得救了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And his mother covered him with kisses, and they were safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.68,1:42:44.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海瑟 多谢你有胆量 最后一次扮演南希\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heather, thanks for having the guts to play Nancy one last time.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.24,1:42:46.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少佛莱迪回到了他应该在的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At last Freddy's back where he belongs.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.92,1:42:48.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,威斯敬上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Regards, Wes.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.76,1:43:07.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是故事吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it a story?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.44,1:43:09.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. It's a story.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.44,1:43:12.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,念给我们听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Read me some.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.80,1:43:17.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一开始是张旧板凳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"We open on an old wooden bench.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.60,1:43:22.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们看到大伙跟工具 还有一只脏脏的手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's fire and tools and a man's grimy hands...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.88,1:43:27.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快地我们发现 那是可怕的爪子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...building what soon is revealed as a gleaming set of claws.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.72,1:43:30.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爪子在动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the claws are moving now...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.24,1:43:35.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像是从漫漫恶梦中醒了过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...as if awakening from a long and unwanted sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.28,1:43:39.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个人将枓动的手平放在桌上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then the man lays one trembling hand flat upon the table...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.48,1:43:43.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟其他的手放在一起 他拿起又尖又利的刀子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and with his other, picks up a thick, sharp blade.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.68,1:43:48.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在灯光后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Behind the lights, faces watch from the darkness...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.44,1:43:53.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从黑暗中观看的脸孔 准备大笑或恐怖尖叫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...ready to laugh or scream in terror."
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.68,1:44:53.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《猛鬼街7》
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.12,1:51:53.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.28,1:51:59.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,[纪念格雷格·冯希卡]
